  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1zu6BsL.png\" alt=\"BushierFlowers 橫幅\" width=\"1023\" height=\"327\"><br>Bushier Flowers 是一款<strong>適用於 Forge 和 Fabric 客戶端與伺服器端</strong>的模組，為原版花卉類型增添了更茂密的變種。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 單一方塊內含多種花卉，具備不同模型與偏移</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">﹂ 對原版花卉使用骨粉右鍵點擊即可生成。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 種植花卉與染料</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">﹂ 成熟的花卉被破壞或使用骨粉後會掉落對應的原版花卉，或可將成熟花卉合成為染料！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 自動化種植</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">﹂ 發射器現在能像複製高雙層植物一樣複製原版花卉！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 用花束裝飾：盆栽、贈禮或重新種植！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">﹂ 使用絲綢之觸或剪刀採集成熟花卉可獲得花束。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 蜜蜂友善</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">﹂ 成熟花卉可像往常一樣用於授粉和繁殖蜜蜂！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#008000\"><strong>❱ 更精美的世界生成：花床</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">﹂ 成熟花卉以密集叢生形式生成，為你的世界增添色彩！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/v3ShkWb.jpg\" alt=\"成熟花卉變種\" width=\"1781\" height=\"1011\"></span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jCmU39i.jpg\" alt=\"成熟盆栽花卉變種\" width=\"1781\" height=\"1011\"></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/9ff4882b-bc4b-4ae3-a45f-c2d388846cc1.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OxN1MBH.png\" alt=\"草地範例\" width=\"1864\" height=\"1049\"></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:24px\">靈感來源：</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模組靈感來自 YouTuber <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/GoodTimesWithScar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GoodTimesWithScar</a><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/GoodTimesWithScar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a>，他提出原版花卉略顯不足的觀點，而我們完全同意！</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ngK_O0UVUQM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">收錄於：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/valhelsia-5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valhelsia 5</a>、&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-botanists-journey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Botanists Journey</a></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
